OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool legend's memorabilia
OL,4,Aexpected to raise #500k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA treasure trove of memorabilia from
OL,7,FLiverpool legend Emlyn Hughes's playing
OL,8,Fdays including match-worn shirts,
OL,9,Fmedals and tracksuits is going under
OL,10,Fthe hammer and is expected to raise up
OL,11,Fto half a million pounds.
OL,13,FNicknamed Crazy Horse during a
OL,14,Ftrophy-laden 13-year career with the
OL,15,FReds, Hughes was one of the club's
OL,16,Fgreats and also captained England. He
OL,17,Fdied in 2004 aged 57 from a brain
OL,18,Ftumour.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
