OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool legend's memorabilia
OL,4,Aexpected to raise #500k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 240 lots, which are being sold by
OL,7,Fthe late star's family, include his
OL,8,F1977 European Cup winners medal, which
OL,9,Fhas a guide price of between #40,000
OL,10,Fand #60,000.
OL,12,FHis son, Emlyn Hughes Jnr, and
OL,13,Fdaughter, Emma Lynn, helped catalogue
OL,14,Fthe collection before it was gathered
OL,15,Ffor auction.
